    { name = 'Alchemy', group = 'Crafting', desc = 'In each band, synthesize one of these until it stops giving skill, then move on. Cheapest first. Merchant prices are fixed; guild shop prices are the most they charge.', steps = {
            { title = 'Alchemy 0–10', note = '• Tsurara (cap 6): Ice Crystal + Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), 2 × Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Bag Of Cornstarch (cap 9): Lightning Crystal + 2 × Ear Of Millioncorn (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 48 gil)\n• Antidote (cap 3): Water Crystal + Wijnruit (Dabih Jajalioh, Ru\'Lude Gardens, 120 gil), Bunch Of San Dorian Grapes (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 79 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Flask Of Deodorizer (cap 10): Wind Crystal + Flask Of Olive Oil (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Sprig Of Chamomile (Dabih Jajalioh, Ru\'Lude Gardens, 130 gil), Sprig Of Sage (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 192 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 10–20', note = '• Vial Of Mercury (cap 16): Lightning Crystal + 4 × Cobalt Jellyfish (Babubu, Port Windurst, 160 gil)\n• Pinch Of Poison Dust (cap 12): Lightning Crystal + 2 × Yellow Globe (Babubu, Port Windurst, 400 gil)\n• Flask Of Echo Drops (cap 20): Water Crystal + Sprig Of Sage (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 192 gil), Pot Of Honey (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 600 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Bee Spatha (cap 14): Water Crystal + 2 × Lump Of Beeswax (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), Spatha (Taniko-Maniko, Port Windurst, 1934 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 20–30', note = '• Jar Of Yellow Textile Dye (cap 29): Water Crystal + Onz Of Turmeric (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 677 gil)\n• Sack Of Baking Soda (cap 22): Lightning Crystal + Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Bottle Of Movalpolos Water (Bartabaq, Oldton Movalpolos, 800 gil)\n• Pot Of Silent Oil (cap 29): Water Crystal + Flask Of Olive Oil (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), 2 × Lump Of Beeswax (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil)\n• Minnow (cap 26), also needs another craft at 10: Fire Crystal + Brass Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 1000 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 30–40', note = '• Blind Dagger (cap 32): Water Crystal + Block Of Animal Glue (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), Flask Of Blinding Potion (Scamplix, Rabao, 1248 gil), Bronze Dagger (Taniko-Maniko, Port Windurst, 162 gil)\n• Blind Knife (cap 34): Water Crystal + Block Of Animal Glue (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), Flask Of Blinding Potion (Scamplix, Rabao, 1248 gil), Bronze Knife (Tavourine, Northern San d\'Oria, 170 gil)\n• Handful Of Blind Bolt Heads (cap 31), also needs another craft at 14: Wind Crystal + Bronze Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 380 gil), Block Of Animal Glue (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), Flask Of Blinding Potion (Scamplix, Rabao, 1248 gil)\n• Minnow (cap 31), also needs another craft at 11: Fire Crystal + Copper Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 600 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 40–50', note = '• Kabenro (cap 50): Earth Crystal + Lump Of Beeswax (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), 2 × Water Lily (Areebah, Upper Jeuno, 630 gil)\n• Loop Of Carbon Fiber (cap 45): Lightning Crystal + 4 × Pinch Of Bomb Ash (Pipiroon, Nashmau, 515 gil)\n• Handful Of Acid Bolt Heads (cap 45), also needs another craft at 14: Wind Crystal + Bronze Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 380 gil), Block Of Animal Glue (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil), Flask Of Vitriol (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 2400 gil)\n• Worm Lure (cap 46), also needs another craft at 12: Fire Crystal + Brass Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 1000 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil), Little Worm (Dwago, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 3 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 50–60', note = '• Flask Of Holy Water (cap 51): Light Crystal + Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Ranka (cap 52): Earth Crystal + 2 × Queen Of The Night (Areebah, Upper Jeuno, 690 gil)\n• Handful Of Wind Arrowheads (cap 57), also needs another craft at 35: Wind Crystal + Copper Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 600 gil), Colibri Beak (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 6250 gil)\n• Bottle Of Hi-potion Drops (cap 60): Fire Crystal + 2 × Sprig Of Sage (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 192 gil), Malboro Vine (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 7230 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 60–70', note = '• Pinch Of Venom Dust (cap 62): Lightning Crystal + 2 × Ogre Eel (Babubu, Port Windurst, 800 gil)\n• Square Of Ebonite (cap 63): Lightning Crystal + Pinch Of Sulfur (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 3825 gil), 2 × Chunk Of Flan Meat (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 700 gil)\n• Flask Of Venom Potion (cap 68): Water Crystal + Vial Of Mercury (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 7500 gil), Pinch Of Venom Dust (Stinknix, Lower Jeuno, 1035 gil)\n• Brilliant Snow (cap 70), also needs another craft at 10: Ice Crystal + Square Of Sheep Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 1000 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Holy Water (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 14500 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 70–80', note = '• Chunk Of High Ebonite (cap 73): Lightning Crystal + Pinch Of Sulfur (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 3825 gil), 3 × Chunk Of Flan Meat (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 700 gil)\n• Flask Of Paralyze Potion (cap 78): Water Crystal + Vial Of Mercury (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 7500 gil), Pinch Of Paralysis Dust (Stinknix, Lower Jeuno, 2000 gil)\n• Spartan Bullet (cap 71), also needs another craft at 13: Fire Crystal + Copper Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 600 gil), Bronze Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 380 gil), Jar Of Firesand (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 22400 gil), Pinch Of Twinkle Powder (Upih Khachla, Windurst Waters, 400 gil)\n• Air Rider (cap 78), also needs another craft at 45: Fire Crystal + Piece Of Lauan Lumber (Chaupire, Northern San d\'Oria, 180 gil), 2 × Jar Of Firesand (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 22400 gil), Sheet Of Bast Parchment (Jabbar, Port Bastok, 5400 gil), Goblin Doll (Pawkrix, Lower Jeuno, 500 gil), Pinch Of Twinkle Powder (Upih Khachla, Windurst Waters, 400 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 80–90', note = '• Square Of Polyflan (cap 83): Lightning Crystal + Chunk Of Flan Meat (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 700 gil), Vial Of Chimera Blood (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 7200 gil)\n• Square Of Holy Leather (cap 87): Light Crystal + Square Of Ram Leather (Kueh Igunahmori, Southern San d\'Oria, 18120 gil), Flask Of Holy Water (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 14500 gil)\n• Ouka Ranman (cap 84), also needs another craft at 23: Earth Crystal + Jar Of Firesand (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 22400 gil), Amaryllis (Dabih Jajalioh, Ru\'Lude Gardens, 120 gil), 2 × Sheet Of Bast Parchment (Jabbar, Port Bastok, 5400 gil)\n• Composite Fishing Rod (cap 89): Fire Crystal + 2 × Cermet Chunk (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 20000 gil), 3 × Loop Of Carbon Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 6000 gil), 2 × Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil)' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 90–100', note = '• Icarus Wing (cap 93): Wind Crystal + 6 × Giant Bird Feather (Kuzah Hpirohpon, Windurst Woods, 4590 gil), 2 × Lump Of Beeswax (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 600 gil)\n• Cannon Shell (cap 94), also needs another craft at 34: Fire Crystal + Brass Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 1000 gil), Iron Ingot (Amulya, Metalworks, 18000 gil), 2 × Jar Of Firesand (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 22400 gil), Bomb Arm (Nogga, Metalworks, 787 gil)\n• Platinum Bullet (cap 95), also needs another craft at 48: Fire Crystal + Platinum Ingot (Bornahn, Al Zahbi, 292500 gil), Jar Of Firesand (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 22400 gil)\n• Max-potion (cap 95): Water Crystal + Alchemy Kit 95' },
            { title = 'Alchemy 100–110', note = '• Azure Cermet (cap 105): Fire Crystal + Cermet Chunk (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 20000 gil), Flask Of Panacea, Azure Leaf\n• Vivi-valve Ii (cap 103): Fire Crystal + Mythril Sheet (Amulya, Metalworks, 60000 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil), Light Bead, Vanir Battery\n• Jug Of Saline Broth (cap 104): Dark Crystal + Vial Of Mercury (Wahraga, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 7500 gil), Vial Of Beastman Blood, Philosophers Stone, Vestige Of A Buried Trait\n• Turbo Charger Ii (cap 103): Fire Crystal + Mythril Sheet (Amulya, Metalworks, 60000 gil), Loop Of Glass Fiber (Maymunah, Bastok Mines, 4000 gil), Glass Sheet, Scroll Of Haste (Quelpia, Selbina, 20800 gil), Mega Fan, Vanir Battery' }
    } },
    { name = 'Cooking', group = 'Crafting', desc = 'In each band, synthesize one of these until it stops giving skill, then move on. Cheapest first. Merchant prices are fixed; guild shop prices are the most they charge.', steps = {
            { title = 'Cooking 0–10', note = '• Ear Of Roasted Corn (cap 2): Fire Crystal + Ear Of Millioncorn (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 48 gil)\n• Hard-boiled Egg (cap 6): Fire Crystal + Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)\n• Jug Of Carrot Broth (cap 3): Water Crystal + 4 × San Dorian Carrot (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 32 gil)\n• Bottle Of Orange Juice (cap 10): Water Crystal + 4 × Saruta Orange (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 33 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 10–20', note = '• Stick Of Selbina Butter (cap 20): Ice Crystal + Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Jug Of Selbina Milk (Dohdjuma, Selbina, 62 gil)\n• Slice Of Sardine (cap 11): Wind Crystal + Hamsi (Jidwahn, Silver Sea route to Nashmau, 140 gil)\n• Tortilla (cap 14): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Ear Of Millioncorn (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 48 gil), Flask Of Olive Oil (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil)\n• Bottle Of Apple Juice (cap 20): Water Crystal + 4 × Faerie Apple (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 45 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 20–30', note = '• Ball Of Insect Paste (cap 29): Earth Crystal + Ear Of Millioncorn (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 48 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Little Worm (Dwago, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 3 gil)\n• Bottle Of Pineapple Juice (cap 30): Water Crystal + 2 × Kazham Pineapple (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 63 gil)\n• Jug Of Soy Milk (cap 21): Fire Crystal + 2 × Pod Of Blue Peas (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 140 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Strip Of Meat Jerky (cap 26): Ice Crystal + Pinch Of Dried Marjoram (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 49 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Slice Of Giant Sheep Meat (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 240 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 30–40', note = '• Loaf Of Black Bread (cap 34): Fire Crystal + Bag Of Rye Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 40 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Loaf Of Iron Bread (cap 34): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Bowl Of Ulbuconut Milk (cap 40): Wind Crystal + Elshimo Coconut (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 180 gil)\n• Ball Of Sardine Paste (cap 31): Earth Crystal + Bag Of Horo Flour (Pawkrix, Lower Jeuno, 40 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Hamsi (Jidwahn, Silver Sea route to Nashmau, 140 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 40–50', note = '• Bottle Of Tomato Juice (cap 43): Water Crystal + Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), 3 × Mithran Tomato (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 42 gil)\n• Bottle Of Grape Juice (cap 50): Dark Crystal + 4 × Bunch Of San Dorian Grapes (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 79 gil)\n• Piece Of Pie Dough (cap 42): Water Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil)\n• Sugar Rusk (cap 45): Fire Crystal + Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Pot Of Maple Sugar (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 41 gil), Loaf Of Iron Bread (Glyke, Upper Jeuno, 100 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 50–60', note = '• Bowl Of Egg Soup (cap 57): Fire Crystal + Pinch Of Black Pepper (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 267 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)\n• Spicy Cracker (cap 59): Fire Crystal + Bunch Of Kazham Peppers (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 63 gil), Box Of Tarutaru Rice (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Bretzel (cap 53): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)\n• Carp Sushi (cap 54): Dark Crystal + Box Of Tarutaru Rice (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Moat Carp (Babubu, Port Windurst, 200 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 60–70', note = '• Block Of Stone Cheese (cap 61): Dark Crystal + Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Jug Of Selbina Milk (Dohdjuma, Selbina, 62 gil)\n• Colored Egg (cap 68): Fire Crystal + La Theine Cabbage (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 24 gil), San Dorian Carrot (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 32 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)\n• Blackened Frog (cap 64): Fire Crystal + Pinch Of Dried Marjoram (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 49 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Copper Frog (Babubu, Port Windurst, 400 gil)\n• Piece Of Raisin Bread (cap 67): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Pot Of Maple Sugar (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 41 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Bunch Of San Dorian Grapes (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 79 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)' },
            { title = 'Cooking 70–80', note = '• Orange Kuchen (cap 80): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Pot Of Maple Sugar (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 41 gil), 2 × Saruta Orange (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 33 gil), Bird Egg (Denvihr, Port Bastok, 58 gil)\n• Serving Of Salmon Meuniere (cap 73): Fire Crystal + Bag Of San Dorian Flour (Komalata, Tavnazian Safehold, 60 gil), Stick Of Selbina Butter (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 300 gil), Pinch Of Black Pepper (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 267 gil), Flask Of Olive Oil (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Cheval Salmon (Babubu, Port Windurst, 400 gil)\n• Cup Of Chocomilk (cap 79): Fire Crystal + Pot Of Maple Sugar (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 41 gil), 4 × Kukuru Bean (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 126 gil), Pot Of Honey (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 600 gil), Jug Of Selbina Milk (Dohdjuma, Selbina, 62 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)\n• Bowl Of Navarin (cap 77): Fire Crystal + Popoto (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 240 gil), Pinch Of Black Pepper (Amalasanda, Lower Jeuno, 267 gil), Flask Of Olive Oil (Aveline, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Chunk Of Rock Salt (Benaige, Southern San d\'Oria, 16 gil), Slice Of Giant Sheep Meat (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 240 gil), Wild Onion (Kopopo, Windurst Waters, 1950 gil), Mithran Tomato (Ghemi Sinterilo, Kazham, 42 gil), Flask Of Distilled Water (Gavrie, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, 12 gil)' },
